The white-space: nowrap; property prevents the text from wrapping to the next line.All text stays on a single line, even if it overflows the box. The box has a light green background with black text in a 25px font size. 3. Setting Value preThe pre value preserves all white spaces and line breaks exactly as they appear in the source code. Text will not wrap and will display exactly as written, emulating the behavior of the <pre> HTML tag. It Preserves white spaces and line breaks as they are in the source code without wrapping text.Syntax: white-space: pre;
