The white-space: pre; property keeps all spaces and line breaks exactly as they are in the code.The text does not wrap to the next line.The box has a light green background with black text in a 25px font size.4. Setting Value pre-lineThe pre-line value collapses multiple spaces into a single space, preserves line breaks, and allows text to wrap within the container as needed. It collapses consecutive spaces into one, preserves line breaks, and wraps text when necessary.Syntax: white-space: pre-line;
