The white-space: pre-line; property removes extra spaces but keeps line breaks in the text.The text wraps automatically within the 300px-wide box. The box has a light green background with black text in a 25px font size. 5. Setting Value pre-wrapThe pre-wrap value preserves all white spaces and line breaks, while also allowing text to wrap within the container as needed. It preserves white spaces and line breaks, and wraps text when necessary. Syntax: white-space: pre-wrap;
